  "why_on_the_list": "Compounder bucket, rank 38. ROIC 19%, net cash, 24% free cash flow margin. Forward P/E 20 vs a 31.5 median, 50% off its all time high, down 38% over 52 weeks.",
  "business_quality": "Duopoly with IAA/RB Global and the better yard footprint. The long term driver is total loss frequency rising as cars get more expensive to repair. The near term problem is insurance claim volumes: households dropped collision coverage or raised deductibles, so fewer cars reach auction. Insider ownership 9%, unusually high for a company this size.",
